# This dependency-free assembly needs no configuration and no API keys — it
# composes the sibling chapter modules and runs on the standard library alone.
# This file is a placeholder for a production build of Architecture 2/3 on the
# managed stack:
#
# FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=<your-foundry-project-endpoint>
# DATAVERSE_URL=<your-dataverse-environment-url>
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=<your-tenant-id>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in only if you wire in live services. Never commit .env.
